wn 48%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.4x, 12.9% of sales), a maintenance pace."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.1%), and institutions hold 89%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (6 sales, net $20.5M sold).","It returns 5.3% a year to shareholders (2.9% in buybacks and 2.6% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 2.2% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 44 consecutive years, raising it 16.9% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 9,600 employees, each generates about $6.1M of revenue, 3.0x the Energy median, and revenue has fallen 5.6% a year across its filed history.","CEO pay is $2.2M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $35K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":75,"head":"Avoid: priced 73% above its fair value of $82.30.","pros":["Composite 44, above the 39 line (gates 13/25)","ROIC 17.5% vs WACC 8.0%","Revenue grew 25.1%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.7x","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["Trades 73% above fair value of $82.30"],"flags":["Priced 73% above its fair value of $82.30"],"need":[],"buy_below":69.96,"vc":{"base":82.3,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":82.3,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.0325,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":13.5876,"ev_ebitda":7.146,"pfcf":14.6331,"pb":1.7432,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0762,"div_yield":0.0357}},"ticker":"COP","date":"2026-11-13"}